OL,3,GNEWSABaby P's mother continues parole
OL,4,Abid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of the toddler known as Baby
OL,7,FP - who died after months of abuse -
OL,8,Fhas continued her bid to be freed from
OL,9,Fprison almost a year after her parole
OL,10,Fhearing was put on hold.
OL,12,FTracey Connelly was jailed at the Old
OL,13,FBailey in 2009 for causing or allowing
OL,14,Fthe death of her 17-month-old son Peter
OL,15,Fat their home in Tottenham, north
OL,16,FLondon, in August 2007.
OL,18,FPublic parole hearings took place last
OL,19,FOctober, but the case was adjourned
OL,20,Fafter the panel decided there needed to
OL,21,Fbe a further psychological assessment.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
