OL,3,GNEWSABaby P's mother continues parole
OL,4,Abid
OL,5,
OL,6,FConnelly told her hearing on Tuesday
OL,7,Fshe "hated every minute" of hearing
OL,8,Fabout the "lifelong" pain and suffering
OL,9,Fof her victims. She also admitted she
OL,10,Fcould be manipulative and
OL,11,Fopportunistic.
